e!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more combos you pull off, the better the <strong>grooves</strong> — and your <strong>Rankman Level</strong> — will climb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195370/extras/24f4c690dfe6ef021954f851c4c9eed4.avif?t=1768885695\" width=425 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💫 <i>Your flow determines the ending… and the ultimate remix of your destiny.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PopSlinger Vol. 2 – Loveless</strong> is your ticket to a <strong>funky, coffee-powered adventure like no other!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >☕ <strong>Developed by Funky Can Creative — Creators of PopSlinger (2022)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "Return to the PopSlinger universe in this coffee-fueled sequel! Join an elite agent and a digital idol on a mission to rescue a lost heroine in a world full of vibrant chaos. Face new enemies, uncover the mysteries of the Purple District, and groove to a freshly brewed beat!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“PopSlinger Vol. 2: Loveless takes everything we loved about the first game and cranks it up with sharper visuals, anime-inspired animation, and an addictive mix of pop and techno music, creating an unforgettable retro-futuristic experience.”<br>ANMTV – Anime, Manga y TV<br><br>“A distinctive shooter that combines rhythm, action, and personality in a memorable way.”<br>Famitsu<br><br>“Stands out for its impressive musical and visual design, combining vibrant neon colors with a New Retro soundtrack that perfectly captures the essence of the game. A unique and fun experience that feels like an interactive animated show.”<br>Arata Latam<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195370/header.jpg?t=1768885695", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195370/cb510453ce4d3e0d78786bfe8b8d534f1a0f65c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768885695", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195370/cb510453ce4d3e0d78786bfe8b8d534f1a0f65c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768885695", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core2 Duo E8400, 3.0GHz or AMD Athlon 64 X2 6000+, 3.0GHz or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce 9600 GT or AMD HD 3870 512MB or higher<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX®-compatible</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "Copyright © Funky Can Creative. All rights reserved.", "developers": ["Funky Can Creative"], "publishers": ["Funky Can Creative"], "demos": [{"appid": 3377700, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 1499, "final": 1499, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$14.99"}, "packages": [1133188], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy PopSlinger Vol. 2 - Loveless", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1133188, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "PopSlinger Vol. 2 - Loveless - $14.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_license": false, "price_in_cents_with_discount": 1499}]}], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "S